          <a href="https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/full/10.1080/23311975.2023.2284444" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Taylor & Francis: Parental Education and Career Aspirations in Delhi NCR</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Peer-reviewed study on academic stress, parental pressure, and mental health among Indian high school students.
          <a href="http://article.sapub.org/10.5923.j.ijpbs.20150501.04.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Academic Stress, Parental Pressure, Anxiety and Mental Health Among Indian High School Students</a>
        </li>
        <li>
          Government of India on NEP 2020's multidisciplinary, subject-flexible higher education structure.
          <a href="https://www.pib.gov.in/PressNoteDetails.aspx?ModuleId=3&NoteId=154950&reg=3&lang=2" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PIB: Higher Education Under NEP 2020</a>
        </li>
        <li>
